'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Quests|Quest]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.
==Dialogue== {{quote|Good afternoon. I desperately need the staff keycards from the TerraGroup laboratory, and you know full well how impossible it is to get even one of those. I heard that Mechanic is willing to trade the cards for some military equipment, but I lack the manpower to gather it currently. This is a matter of life and death. Will you help?}}
==Objectives== *Hand over a [[TerraGroup Labs access keycard]] *Hand over a [[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Violet)]] *Hand over a [[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Yellow)]] *Hand over a [[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Red)]] *Hand over a [[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Green)]] *Hand over a [[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Blue)]] *Hand over a [[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Black)]]
==Rewards== * [[Therapist]] Rep <font color="green">'''+0.15'''</font> * 5× [[26x75mm flare cartridge (Acid Green)]] * 5× [[M.U.L.E. stimulant injector]] * 5× [[eTG-change regenerative stimulant injector]] * 5× [[SJ1 TGLabs combat stimulant injector]] * 5× [[SJ6 TGLabs combat stimulant injector]] * Unlocks barter for [[26x75mm flare cartridge (Acid Green)]] at [[Therapist]] LL1 * Unlocks achievement [[Achievements#Event_achievements|A Key to Salvation]] {{Quote|Thank you! I don't know how or where you got them, but now I can get the equipment that will surely delight my cust— Ahem, patients, of course. These cards are the key to salvation no less!}}
==Guide== {| class="wikitable" ! colspan="5" |Related Quest Items |- !Icon !Item name !Amount !Requirement !'''[[Found in raid|Find in Raid]]''' |- |[[File:Terragroup Labs access keycard icon.png|link=TerraGroup Labs access keycard]] |[[TerraGroup Labs access keycard]] |1 |Handover item !<font color="green">No</font> |- |[[File:Lab. key. Security post icon.png|link=TerraGroup Labs keycard (Violet)]] |[[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Violet)]] |1 |Handover item !<font color="green">No</font> |- |[[File:Lab. key. Alarm system control panel icon.png|link=TerraGroup Labs keycard (Yellow)]] |[[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Yellow)]] |1 |Handover item !<font color="green">No</font> |- |[[File:Lab. key. Security arsenal.png|link=TerraGroup Labs keycard (Red)]] |[[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Red)]] |1 |Handover item !<font color="green">No</font> |- |[[File:Lab Key Block2.png|link=TerraGroup Labs keycard (Green)]] |[[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Green)]] |1 |Handover item !<font color="green">No</font> |- |[[File:Lab. key. The quarantine zone icon.png|link=TerraGroup Labs keycard (Blue)]] |[[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Blue)]] |1 |Handover item !<font color="green">No</font> |- |[[File:LkEA Icon.png|link=TerraGroup Labs keycard (Black)]] |[[TerraGroup Labs keycard (Black)]] |1 |Handover item !<font color="green">No</font> |}
The [[Keys_%26_Intel#The_Lab|keycards]] can be bartered from [[Mechanic]] LL1 for a various number of [[6-STEN-140-M military battery|6-STEN-140-M military batteries]].
The batteries have 3 guaranteed spawns on [[Customs]] each raid: *On the roof of the three-story dorms building *Inside the new gas station *On the second floor of the Scav base (ZB-013 extraction) building
Each location is defended by [[Scav Raiders]].
